<instruction name="STD">
 <copyright>Copyright (C) Intel Corporation. All Rights Reserved.</copyright>
 <shortdesc>Set Direction Flag</shortdesc>
 <longdesc><para unique="1091440">
   <string>Sets the </string><indexterm><primary>DF (direction) flag, EFLAGS register</primary></indexterm><string>DF flag in the EFLAGS register. When the DF flag is set to 1, string operations decrement the index regis&#173;ters (</string><indexterm><primary>ESI register;EDI register</primary></indexterm><string>ESI and/or EDI). Operation is the same in all modes.</string></para>
  </longdesc>
 <subsection title="Flags Affected">
  <para unique="1091445">
   <string>The DF flag is set. The CF, OF, ZF, SF, AF, and PF flags are unaffected.</string></para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Exceptions (All Operating Modes)">
  <variablelist>
   <variablelistentry>
    <term><string>#UD </string></term>
    <listitem><string>If the LOCK prefix is used.</string></listitem>
    </variablelistentry>
   </variablelist>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
